NLR Airfoil with Flap. Turbulent Flow.
M = 0.2, p 14.7, T 520.0 R. Alpha = 0.0
nlrflap.dat

freestream static 0.2 14.7 520. 0. 0.
downstream pressure freestream zone 1
turbulence spalart allmaras  

loads
   zone 1
   print totals zones lift frequency 20
   reference area 1
   reference length 1.0
   reference moment center 0.25 0.0 0.0
   subset i 29 177 j 1 1 k 1 1 force noslip
endloads

converge order 5
cycles 1000
iterations per cycle 5

cfl# 1.5

end
